<%doc>

=head1 NAME

trait_columns.mas - a mason component for displaying message 
when a user tries to submit traits file with wrong order of column data...
=AUTHOR

Isaak Y Tecle (iyt2@cornell.edu)

=cut

</%doc>

<%args>

$error
$guide

</%args>

<%perl>
$error .= qq |<p>請<a href="javascript:history.go(-1)"><b>返回(back)</b></a>並重新排列欄位順序，然後再次上傳檔案，或者如果您持續遇到問題，請聯繫我們(rearrange the order of the columns and upload the file again or if you keep having problem with it contact us)。
              </p>
             |;
</%perl>

<& /page/page_title.mas, title => '性狀檔案(Traits file)' &>
<&| /page/info_section.mas, title => '', subtitle => $guide &>
  <% $error %>  
</&>
